<title>FINLAND: Clinton condemns Tel Aviv bomb attack.</title>
<headline>Clinton condemns Tel Aviv bomb attack.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton condemned the bomb attack in Tel Aviv which killed two people and said violence had no place in the Middle East peace process.</p>
<p>&quot;I condemn it...,&quot; Clinton told a news conference after a summit with Russian President Boris Yeltsin. &quot;There is no place for such acts of terror and violence in the peace process.&quot;</p>
</text>
